OL,5,G1855 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FFather and daughter Shane and
OL,7,     FEmily hope to dazzle with the
OL,8,     Fdecor at The Nest Hotel in
OL,9,     FHampshire, before a visit to a
OL,10,     Ffarm descends into mudslinging -
OL,11,     Fliterally.
OL,12,G1925 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FThe B&Bers visit Simon and
OL,14,     FHarriet's old-school village pub,
OL,15,     FThe Queen's Head Inn, in
OL,16,     FNorthamptonshire, where the bacon
OL,17,     Fgets a bashing at breakfast.
