OL,5,G2100 24 Hours in A&E
OL,6,     FThis episode meets older patients
OL,7,     Fat King's hospital who've had to
OL,8,     Fshow resilience in their lives.
OL,9,     FAnd junior doctor Jim tries to get
OL,10,     Fsome Lego out of toddler Zara's
OL,11,     Fnose.
OL,12,G2200 24 Hours in A&E
OL,13,     FLinden, who's 15, is at King's
OL,14,     Fafter cutting his leg backflipping
OL,15,     Foff a shed onto a trampoline. And
OL,16,     FAntony - who has smoked for 40
OL,17,     Fyears - has lost all feeling in
OL,18,     Fhis left leg.
